# =============================================================================
# Apply Indian Standard Material — FreeCAD 1.0.2 Compatible
# Categories: Sheet Metal | Piping | Casting | Alloys | Plastic | Rubber
# =============================================================================
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Select a Body in the model tree (or just open the file with one Body).
#   2. Run this macro.
#   3. Choose a tab, pick a material, click Apply Material.
# =============================================================================

